title: The Heartland Bulwark
new-page: true
is-card: true
view-if: heartland_leader = "Pendrigon" and in_popular_front_heartland = 1 or in_left_front_heartland = 1 and heartland_affairs_timer <= 0
on-arrival: heartland_affairs_timer += 6; month_actions += 1
tags: govt_affairs
card-image: img/braun.jpg
#subtitle: The state government of Heartland is a bulwark of democracy...

= Heartland Affairs

Heartland, by far the largest and most important state in the Commonwealth, is governed by our party, in a coalition with the [? if in_popular_front_heartland: [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionists</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?], [? if ddp_in_popular_front_heartland and not lvp_formed: [? if ddp_name == "Gold": <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**Democratic**</span>?][? if ddp_name == "DStP": <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**State**</span>?]?] and <span style="color: #700000;">**Communist**</span> parties.?][? if in_left_front_heartland: <span style="color: #700000;">**Communists**</span>.?] It is the most left-wing state government in the Commonwealth, led by Emrys Pendrigon.

We can enact policies in Heartland. [? if president == "DuFour": However, President DuFour and the political right are closely monitoring our every move and can invoke Commonwealth intervention at any time. Tread lightly. ?]

- @police_loyalty: Bolster the loyalty of the police.
- @police_strength: Recruit additional police.
- @bureaucracy: Purge the bureaucracy of <span style="color: #808080;">reactionary</span> elements.
- @ban_sa: Ban the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**SA**</span>, the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalist</span> paramilitary group.
- @ban_sh: Ban the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Wardens**</span>, the Nationalist paramilitary.
- @unban_rfb: Reverse the <span style="color: #8B0000;">**RFB**</span> ban.
- @free_kpd: Protect <span style="color: #8B0000;">**Collectivists**</span> demonstrations from the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">far</span>-<span style="color: #3E88B3;">right</span>.
- @root: No new policies are needed.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@police_loyalty
view-if: heartland_police_loyalty < 1
on-arrival: heartland_police_loyalty += 0.15; vanguard_strength += 25; reichsexekution += 1

The police have historically been overrun with <span style="color: #808080;">reactionaries</span>, and we are trying to change this, little by little. We have improved the training and recruitment process to select for a broader demographic than the traditional <span style="color: #3E88B3;">conservatives</span>, and to put a tighter leash on their political activity. In addition, we set up committees to investigate the ranks of the police and remove those with <span style="color: #7A3C00;">far</span>-<span style="color: #3E88B3;">right</span> sympathies. The <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> have also began to infiltrate some of their own into the police force...

Current police loyalty: [+ heartland_police_loyalty : loyalty +].

@police_strength
on-arrival: heartland_police_strength += 30; vanguard_strength += 50

We have increased the size of the Heartland police.

@bureaucracy
on-arrival: heartland_purge += 1; heartland_police_loyalty += 0.08; nationalism -= 5; pacifism += 1; democratization += 2; pro_republic += 3*(1-dissent); burgher_marcher += 2*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 3; burgher_marcher += 2*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 4; coup_progress += 0.5; gold_left += 2; ddp_left += 1; lvp_left += 1.5; reichsexekution += 1; bureaucracy_goal_heartland -= 1; burgher_collectivist += 2

The bureaucracy is deeply <span style="color: #808080;">reactionary</span>, and many abuse their power to favor the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">political right</span>. By removing the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">pro-monarchy</span> and <span style="color: #7A3C00;">pro-dictatorship</span> elements, we can democratize it. The <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> have also began to infiltrate some of their own into the state bureaucracy...

@ban_sa
view-if: loyalist_banned == 0
on-arrival: loyalist_strength *= 0.9; loyalist_strength *= 0.75 if heartland_police_loyalty >= 0.75; loyalist_banned_pro = 1 if heartland_police_loyalty >= 0.75; loyalist_banned_pro = 0 if heartland_police_loyalty < 0.75; loyalist_banned = 1; gold_relation -= 3; heartland_police_loyalty -= 0.05; loyalist_militancy -= 0.05; loyalist_ban_timer = 6; interior_goal_heartland -= 1; coup_progress -= 2 if coup_progress >= 6

As it turns out, the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalist</span> <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**SA**</span> has many allies in the police and bureaucracy. Our relationship with the police weakens, and the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**SA**</span> can still organize illegally, right under the police's noses. [? if loyalist_banned_pro : Nevertheless, the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**SA**</span> is substantially weakened by our ban. ?] 

[? if coup_progress >= 6: There are reports of an imminent coup by the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">far</span>-<span style="color: #3E88B3;">right</span>. We have disrupted some of these plans, but the threat is still present. ?]

@ban_sh
on-arrival: warden_strength *= 0.85; warden_strength *= 0.7 if heartland_police_loyalty >= 0.75; warden_banned = 1; gold_relation -= 5; lvp_relation -= 2; heartland_police_loyalty -= 0.1; coalition_dissent += 1 if marcher_in_government = 1 and in_grand_coalition = 1 and president = "DuFour"; warden_ban_timer = 6; interior_goal_heartland -= 1; warden_coup_progress = coup_progress; coup_progress -= 1 if coup_progress >= 6; dufour_angry += 5
view-if: warden_banned == 0

[? if president == "DuFour": Banning the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Wardens**</span> weakens our relationship with President DuFour, as well as the political <span style="color: #3E88B3;">right</span> and the police. ?][? if president != "DuFour": Banning the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Wardens**</span> weakens our relationship with the political <span style="color: #3E88B3;">right</span> and the police. ?] [? if marcher_in_government = 1 and in_grand_coalition = 1 and president = "DuFour" : It also weakens our coalition due to the influence of DuFour on the <span style="color: #C0A054;">right</span> wing of our coalition. ?] In addition, the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Wardens**</span> still operates out of public sight. 

@unban_rfb
view-if: vanguard_banned = 1
on-arrival: vanguard_banned = 0; vanguard_strength += 100; heartland_police_loyalty -= 0.1; vanguard_goal_heartland -= 1; dufour_angry += 8

The <span style="color: #700000;">Communist</span> <span style="color: #700000;">**RFB**</span> is no longer banned.

@free_kpd
view-if: vanguard_banned = 0
on-arrival: vanguard_banned = 0; vanguard_strength += 50; vanguard_militancy += 0.03; heartland_police_loyalty -= 0.05; commons_collectivist += 4; disfavored_collectivist += 4; free_collectivist_goal_heartland -= 1; reichsexekution += 1; gold_relation -= 5; ddp_relation -= 4; lvp_relation -= 5; unionist_relation -= 4; gold_right += 2; ddp_right += 1; ddp_cohesion -= 0.5; lvp_right += 1.5; left_dissent -= 5; reformist_dissent += 5

Restrictions are lifted and police are deployed to protect <span style="color: #700000;">Communist</span> demonstrations and organizations from the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">far</span>-<span style="color: #3E88B3;">right</span>.